{
  "meta": {
    "version": 3,
    "updatedBy": "copilot",
    "note": "Windows Fluent UI for OpenClaw — ported from the v1 raw-CSS components.jsonc to v3 Auto Layout. WinUI-derived pixel padding is snapped to the nearest 4px spacing token; per-component notes record the source values and any approximation."
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "name": "SidebarSubtleStyles",
      "note": "Prototype-only adapter for the Dashboard scene graph, whose layout hotspots do not expose component states. Reuses ComposerPicker and ChatComposer subtle controls: transparent rest, subtleHover, subtlePressed, sm radius and accent keyboard focus. Scoped to this prototype sidebar so existing components and other screens are unchanged. Native port uses WinUI subtle Button and NavigationViewItem styles, not these prototype selectors.",
      "root": {
        "id": "sidebar-subtle-styles",
        "el": "style",
        "children": [
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-nav-toggle'].proto-tappable:hover {{ outline: none; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='refresh-settings-sidebar'] .ds-btn {{ background: transparent; border: 0; box-shadow: none; color: var(--color-ink); width: 100% !important; justify-content: flex-start !important; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='refresh-settings-sidebar'] .ds-btn:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); outline: none; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='refresh-settings-sidebar'] .ds-btn:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sidebar'] .proto-tappable {{ outline: none; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sidebar'] .proto-tappable:hover {{ outline: none; background: var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sidebar'] .proto-tappable:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-home-selected']:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover) !important; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-home-selected']:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed) !important; }}",
          ":is([data-proto-node-id='dashboard-new-session'],[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sessions-add']).ds-btn {{ width: var(--space-6); height: var(--space-6); min-width: var(--space-6); padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons', 'Segoe MDL2 Assets', sans-serif; font-size: var(--space-5); line-height: 1; background: transparent; border: 0; box-shadow: none; color: var(--color-muted); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }}",
          ":is([data-proto-node-id='dashboard-new-session'],[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sessions-add']).ds-btn:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          ":is([data-proto-node-id='dashboard-new-session'],[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sessions-add']).ds-btn:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          ":is([data-proto-node-id='dashboard-new-session'],[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-sessions-add']).ds-btn:focus-visible {{ outline: calc(var(--space-1) / 2) solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: calc(var(--space-1) / -2); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-assistant-chevron'] {{ font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons', 'Segoe MDL2 Assets', sans-serif !important; line-height: 1; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-notifications'].ds-btn {{ width:var(--space-6);height:var(--space-6);min-width:var(--space-6);flex-shrink:0;padding:0;background:transparent;border:0;box-shadow:none;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);color:var(--color-muted);font-family:'Segoe Fluent Icons','Segoe MDL2 Assets',sans-serif;font-size:var(--space-4);line-height:1; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-notifications'].ds-btn:hover {{ background:var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-notifications'].ds-btn:active {{ background:var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-notifications'].ds-btn:focus-visible {{ outline:calc(var(--space-1)/2) solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:calc(var(--space-1)/-2); }}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentPageStyles",
      "note": "Preview adapter derived from production WinUI controls, not shipping CSS. SettingsPage and PermissionsPage use card rows with ToggleSwitch; SessionsPage and UsagePage use SelectorBar; CronPage uses ComboBox; DebugPage uses InfoBar and SettingsExpander. Colors reference existing tokens mapped to ThemeResource brushes. Dimensions are spacing-token expressions; production keeps the native control templates. Page width is the production 900px cap expressed with existing spacing tokens.",
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-page-styles",
        "el": "style",
        "children": [
          "[data-proto-node-id^='refresh-page-'], [data-proto-node-id^='refresh-settings-']:not([data-proto-node-id='refresh-settings-sidebar']) {{ box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; max-width: calc(var(--space-8) * 14 + var(--space-1)); margin-inline: auto; }}",
          ".fluent-switch {{ display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0; width: var(--space-7); height: var(--space-6); flex-shrink: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--color-ink); border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }}",
          ".fluent-switch-track {{ display: block; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; width: calc(var(--space-5) + var(--space-4)); height: calc(var(--space-4) + var(--space-1)); border: calc(var(--space-1) / 4) solid var(--color-muted); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }}",
          ".fluent-switch-thumb {{ position: absolute; width: var(--space-3); height: var(--space-3); top: 50%; left: calc(var(--space-1) - var(--space-1) / 4); transform: translateY(-50%); background: var(--color-ink); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }}",
          ".fluent-switch[aria-checked='true'] .fluent-switch-track {{ background: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); }}",
          ".fluent-switch[aria-checked='true'] .fluent-switch-thumb {{ left: calc(var(--space-5) - var(--space-1) / 4); background: var(--color-accentInk); }}",
          ".fluent-switch[aria-checked='false']:hover .fluent-switch-track {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); border-color: var(--color-ink); }}",
          ".fluent-switch:active .fluent-switch-thumb {{ width: var(--space-4); }}",
          ".fluent-switch[aria-checked='true']:active .fluent-switch-thumb {{ left: calc(var(--space-5) - var(--space-1) - var(--space-1) / 4); }}",
          ".fluent-switch.proto-tappable:hover, .fluent-selection.proto-tappable:hover, .fluent-expander.proto-tappable:hover {{ outline: none; }}",
          ".fluent-selection {{ position: relative; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: transparent; color: var(--color-ink); min-height: var(--space-6); padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); white-space: normal; }}",
          ".fluent-selection:hover, .fluent-expander:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          ".fluent-selection:active, .fluent-expander:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          ".fluent-selection[aria-pressed='true'], .fluent-selection[aria-current='page'] {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); font-weight: 600; }}",
          ".fluent-selection[aria-pressed='true']::after {{ content: ''; position: absolute; width: var(--space-4); height: calc(var(--space-1) / 2); background: var(--color-accent); bottom: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }}",
          ".fluent-selection[aria-current='page']::after {{ content: ''; position: absolute; width: calc(var(--space-1) / 2); height: var(--space-4); background: var(--color-accent); left: 0; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); border-radius: var(--radius-pill); }}",
          ".fluent-navigation {{ width: 100%; text-align: left; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id^='fluent-row-title-'], .fluent-info strong {{ font-weight: 600 !important; }}",
          ".fluent-combo-shell {{ display: inline-flex; position: relative; width: calc(var(--space-6) * 5); max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; }}",
          ".fluent-combo {{ appearance: none; font: inherit; color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-control); border: calc(var(--space-1) / 4) solid var(--color-controlLine); border-bottom-color: var(--color-muted); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); width: 100%; height: var(--space-6); padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-6) var(--space-1) var(--space-3); }}",
          ".fluent-combo:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          ".fluent-combo:focus-visible {{ outline: calc(var(--space-1) / 2) solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: calc(var(--space-1) / 2); }}",
          ".fluent-combo-arrow {{ pointer-events: none; position: absolute; right: var(--space-3); top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons', 'Segoe MDL2 Assets', sans-serif; font-size: var(--space-3); }}",
          ".fluent-info {{ display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); align-items: flex-start; padding: var(--space-4); background: var(--color-surface); border: calc(var(--space-1) / 4) solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }}",
          ".fluent-info-icon {{ color: var(--color-muted); font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons', 'Segoe MDL2 Assets', sans-serif; font-size: var(--space-4); flex-shrink: 0; line-height: var(--space-5); }}",
          ".fluent-info-warning .fluent-info-icon {{ color: var(--color-warning); }}",
          ".fluent-info-critical .fluent-info-icon {{ color: var(--color-critical); }}",
          ".fluent-info-positive .fluent-info-icon {{ color: var(--color-positive); }}",
          ".fluent-expander {{ width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-4); border: calc(var(--space-1) / 4) solid var(--color-line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-surface); text-align: left; }}",
          ".fluent-expander-chevron {{ font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons', 'Segoe MDL2 Assets', sans-serif; font-size: var(--space-3); margin-left: auto; }}",
          ".fluent-expander[aria-expanded='true'] .fluent-expander-chevron {{ transform: rotate(180deg); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id^='fluent-status-positive'] {{ border-left: var(--space-1) solid var(--color-positive) !important; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id^='fluent-status-warning'] {{ border-left: var(--space-1) solid var(--color-warning) !important; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id^='fluent-status-critical'] {{ border-left: var(--space-1) solid var(--color-critical) !important; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id^='fluent-status-neutral'] {{ border-left: var(--space-1) solid var(--color-muted) !important; }}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentToggleSwitch",
      "note": "Derived from SettingsPage.xaml and PermissionsPage.xaml ToggleSwitch with MinWidth=0 and empty OnContent/OffContent. The label stays in the SettingsCard row. Preview uses a button with switch semantics; scene state supplies checked and handles toggling. Native port uses ToggleSwitch, never this HTML. Track uses accent/ink/muted tokens as the browser approximation of the platform control template.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Enable feature",
        "checked": "false"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-switch-root",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "fluent-switch",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "role": "switch",
          "aria-label": "{label}",
          "aria-checked": "{checked}"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": {
            "kind": "outline",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "fluent-switch-track",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "fluent-switch-track",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "fluent-switch-thumb",
                "el": "span",
                "class": "fluent-switch-thumb"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentSelectorItem",
      "note": "SelectorBarItem preview from SessionsPage.xaml ChannelSelector and UsagePage.xaml PeriodSelector. Selected state has a system-accent underline; no outlined-button chrome. Scene state supplies selection. Native port uses SelectorBar with its platform selection and keyboard behavior.",
      "props": {
        "label": "All",
        "selected": "false"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-selector-item",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "fluent-selection",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "aria-pressed": "{selected}",
          "style": "color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-body-size);line-height:var(--text-body-line-height)"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": {
            "kind": "outline",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "{label}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentNavigationItem",
      "note": "NavigationViewItem preview from HubWindow.xaml: transparent item, subtle selected fill and leading accent indicator. Native port remains NavigationView, not a list of ordinary form buttons.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Settings",
        "current": "false"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-navigation-item",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "fluent-selection fluent-navigation",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "aria-current": "{current}",
          "style": "color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-body-size);line-height:var(--text-body-line-height)"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": {
            "kind": "outline",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "{label}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentComboBox",
      "note": "Compact ComboBox preview from SettingsPage.xaml AppThemeComboBox and CronPage.xaml schedule selectors. The three option labels are props; native HTML selection is local and resets when its scene rerenders. Native port uses ComboBox and existing view-model bindings.",
      "props": {
        "label": "App theme",
        "first": "System",
        "second": "Light",
        "third": "Dark"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-combo-shell",
        "el": "span",
        "class": "fluent-combo-shell",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-body-size);line-height:var(--text-body-line-height)"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "fluent-combo-select",
            "el": "select",
            "class": "fluent-combo",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-label": "{label}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "fluent-combo-first",
                "el": "option",
                "children": [
                  "{first}"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "fluent-combo-second",
                "el": "option",
                "children": [
                  "{second}"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "fluent-combo-third",
                "el": "option",
                "children": [
                  "{third}"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "fluent-combo-arrow",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "fluent-combo-arrow",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              ""
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentInfoBar",
      "note": "InfoBar preview based on SessionsPage.xaml ConnectionInfoBar and DebugPage.xaml StatusInfoBar. It uses a neutral card surface with semantic status glyph and text, retaining the seeded token palette. Native port uses InfoBar Severity so Windows supplies its exact severity background, contrast theme, and live-region behavior.",
      "props": {
        "title": "Information",
        "message": "Preview information.",
        "severity": "info",
        "glyph": ""
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-info-root",
        "el": "div",
        "class": "fluent-info fluent-info-{severity}",
        "attrs": {
          "role": "status"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "fluent-info-icon",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "fluent-info-icon",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              "{glyph}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "fluent-info-body",
            "el": "div",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "vertical",
              "gap": "1",
              "width": "fill"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "fluent-info-title",
                "el": "strong",
                "appearance": {
                  "color": "ink",
                  "textStyle": "body"
                },
                "children": [
                  "{title}"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "fluent-info-message",
                "el": "span",
                "appearance": {
                  "color": "muted",
                  "textStyle": "caption"
                },
                "children": [
                  "{message}"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentExpanderHeader",
      "note": "Expander header preview from SkillsPage.xaml EnabledExpander, SandboxPage.xaml ScopeExpander and DebugPage.xaml SettingsExpander. Scene state shows or hides the following content, with a real button and aria-expanded. Native port keeps Expander or SettingsExpander as used by its owning page.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Details",
        "expanded": "false"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-expander-header",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "fluent-expander",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "aria-expanded": "{expanded}",
          "style": "color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-body-size);line-height:var(--text-body-line-height)"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": {
            "kind": "outline",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        "children": [
          "{label}",
          {
            "id": "fluent-expander-chevron",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "fluent-expander-chevron",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              ""
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "FluentIcon",
      "note": "FontIcon preview using production FluentIconCatalog glyphs and SymbolThemeFontFamily's Segoe Fluent Icons / Segoe MDL2 Assets fallback.",
      "props": {
        "glyph": ""
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "fluent-icon",
        "el": "span",
        "attrs": {
          "aria-hidden": "true",
          "style": "font-family:'Segoe Fluent Icons','Segoe MDL2 Assets',sans-serif;font-size:var(--space-4);line-height:1;color:var(--color-muted)"
        },
        "appearance": {
          "color": "muted"
        },
        "children": [
          "{glyph}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "CompanionMenuStyles",
      "note": "Prototype-only floating surfaces. Menu options/order follow upstream app-sidebar-agent-menu.ts; companion navigation follows HubWindow.xaml without Chat. The right-hand event window previews ConnectionStatusWindow.xaml, not System vitals. Native implementation must use MenuFlyout and WindowManager-owned windows. Browser click-away dismissal is simulated with a backdrop; native menu focus and Escape handling are not implemented here.",
      "root": {
        "id": "companion-menu-styles",
        "el": "style",
        "children": [
          "[data-proto-node-id='dashboard-root'] {{ position: relative; isolation: isolate; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='footer-menu-dismiss'] {{ position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 40; background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 0; cursor: default; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='footer-menu-dismiss']:hover {{ outline: none; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='footer-account-menu'], [data-proto-node-id='footer-help-menu'] {{ position: absolute; z-index: 41; width: calc(var(--space-8) * 4 + var(--space-7)); max-height: calc(100% - var(--space-8) * 2); overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='footer-account-menu'] {{ left: var(--space-3); bottom: var(--space-8); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='footer-help-menu'] {{ left: calc(var(--space-8) * 5 + var(--space-1)); bottom: calc(var(--space-8) * 2); width: calc(var(--space-8) * 4); }}",
          ".companion-menu-item {{ display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); width: 100%; min-height: calc(var(--space-6) + var(--space-2)); padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); box-sizing: border-box; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: transparent; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-body-size); line-height: var(--text-body-line-height); color: var(--color-ink); }}",
          ".companion-menu-item:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); outline: none; }}",
          ".companion-menu-item:active {{ background: var(--color-subtlePressed); }}",
          ".companion-menu-icon, .companion-menu-chevron {{ font-family: 'Segoe Fluent Icons','Segoe MDL2 Assets',sans-serif; font-size: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-muted); flex-shrink: 0; }}",
          ".companion-menu-chevron {{ margin-left: auto; font-size: var(--space-3); }}",
          ".companion-build-chip {{ font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--text-caption-size); padding: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-muted); background: transparent; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }}",
          ".companion-build-chip:hover {{ background: var(--color-subtleHover); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='companion-floating-window'], [data-proto-node-id='connection-event-window'] {{ position: absolute; z-index: 30; top: var(--space-7); bottom: var(--space-3); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='companion-floating-window'] {{ left: var(--space-4); right: var(--space-4); width: auto; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='connection-event-window'] {{ right: var(--space-3); width: min(calc(var(--space-8) * 10 + var(--space-7)), calc(100% - var(--space-5))); z-index: 35; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='companion-floating-window'] [data-proto-node-id='floating-settings-root'] {{ height: 100%; min-height: 0; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='connection-event-grid'] {{ min-height: 0; }}",
          "[data-proto-node-id='connection-event-log'] {{ font-family: var(--font-mono); }}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "CompanionMenuItem",
      "note": "Fluent menu-row preview. Scene actions close the footer menu and open the correct window/page atomically. Native port uses MenuFlyoutItem/SubItem.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Settings",
        "glyph": "",
        "chevron": ""
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "companion-menu-item",
        "el": "button",
        "class": "companion-menu-item",
        "attrs": {
          "type": "button",
          "style": "color:var(--color-ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-body-size);line-height:var(--text-body-line-height)"
        },
        "control": {
          "chrome": "none",
          "focus": {
            "kind": "outline",
            "color": "accent"
          }
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "companion-menu-icon",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "companion-menu-icon",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              "{glyph}"
            ]
          },
          "{label}",
          {
            "id": "companion-menu-chevron",
            "el": "span",
            "class": "companion-menu-chevron",
            "attrs": {
              "aria-hidden": "true"
            },
            "children": [
              "{chevron}"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "CompanionHelpLink",
      "note": "Preserves the exact four upstream Help destinations. Links open only on an explicit user click, in a new tab with noopener/noreferrer.",
      "props": {
        "label": "Documentation",
        "href": "https://docs.openclaw.ai",
        "glyph": ""
      },
