    {
      "name": "ChatComposer",
      "note": "Chat input. A rounded `control` panel (`md` radius) with a hairline `controlLine` border wrapping a borderless, transparent, auto-growing textarea over a toolbar. Left cluster = Add, session picker, model picker, reasoning-effort picker; right cluster = Dictate (mic), Speaker, Settings, and the primary Send. Only Send spends the accent (it swaps to a subtle Stop while a turn is active, and reads disabled/greyed until the textarea has content); every other control ships as a WinUI subtle transparent Button (SubtleFillColorTransparent rest, SubtleFillColorSecondary hover, SubtleFillColorTertiary press, ControlCornerRadius) with a `muted` (TextFillColorSecondary) glyph, so the toolbar reads as quiet chrome. Each picker (see ComposerPicker) is a subtle borderless dropdown with muted value text; a picker with nothing to choose (for example the session picker when only one session exists) renders disabled, so its label reads a shade lighter than its enabled neighbours, as with `Main session` in the preview. Textarea min 56 / max 200px growth and the 12px outer margin are Reactor port notes; the app tightens top padding to 2px below token 1. The subtle icon controls are real `button`s whose browser chrome is removed via `control.chrome:none`, so the transparent WinUI rest state (SubtleFillColorTransparent, `$none`) shows with no web button border; each carries `states` for hover (`subtleHover`) and press (`subtlePressed`) and a `control.focus` accent focus rectangle, and only the filled Send spends the accent. The message input renders as a borderless, typeable `contenteditable` `role=textbox` showing the muted placeholder; `control.chrome:none` removes the browser field chrome and its focus ring. The focused input keeps the same borderless appearance without an accent underline; the text caret indicates the insertion point, while toolbar controls retain their keyboard-focus rectangles. The hairline `controlLine` border belongs to the outer `control` panel only. (Preview shows the rest state with the placeholder visible; click to type.)",
      "props": {
        "placeholder": "Message Assistant (Enter to send)",
        "session": "Main session",
        "model": "Claude Sonnet 5",
        "effort": "Default"
      },
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-composer-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "2",
          "padding": "2",
          "width": "fill"
        },
        "margin": "3",
        "appearance": {
          "background": "control",
          "borderColor": "controlLine",
          "radius": "md"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "chat-composer-input",
            "el": "div",
            "attrs": {
              "contenteditable": "true",
              "role": "textbox",
              "aria-multiline": "true",
              "aria-label": "Message input"
            },
            "layout": {
              "padding": "2",
              "width": "fill",
              "height": 56
            },
            "appearance": {
              "fontFamily": "body",
              "textStyle": "body",
              "color": "muted"
            },
            "control": {
              "chrome": "none"
            },
            "children": [
              "{placeholder}"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "chat-composer-toolbar",
